<a:Text>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Microsoft Sans Serif;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.19041}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Remember to \b uncheck the &#39;Primary key&#39; and &#39;Mandatory&#39;\b0  boxes of the Email field in the Contain table when converting from CDM to PDM\par
}
</a:Text>
